File mode prints every frontmatter field in source order, even when a glob view would show only
the first three with `description` and `title` first.
== args
input/many.md
== file input/many.md
---
b: 1
c: 2
title: Guide
d: 3
description: What this guide covers.
---
== stdout
input/many.md (7 lines)
b: 1
c: 2
title: "Guide"
d: 3
description: "What this guide covers."
== stderr
== exit 0
